{"server":"tw","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_09_end","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_09","title":"得果","storyCode":"HS-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"960e26d7caf391ccb5d387a2ff264729d498bd7333a14d0a1d43b10ca1c1538d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"黍與望達成了一項交易，績和望最終還是帶走了“山河百景圖”，大荒城恢復了安寧。在田間小路上，老天師攔住了績，她最後還要問他一個問題。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"誰料到會有這樣的一場雪？\n田壟上厚厚地覆蓋著一層令人絕望的白，星星點點的黃色，是月前剛剛種下的麥子艱難地探出的頭。\n一旬後還能活下幾株？叫人不敢想。\n一隻鼷獸東奔西走，跌跌撞撞來到這片寂靜的麥田。\n眼前稀稀拉拉的莊稼對它來說算是意外之喜，它小心地嗅聞著，盤算著多少夠填飽一半自己的肚子，還有多少夠帶回洞穴裡餵養同族。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到一柄粗鐵鋤頭落在它的脊椎上。\n又少了三株麥子。\n氣憤的農夫抓住了那隻糟蹋莊稼的畜生，恨不得將其扒皮啖肉，可瘦得只剩骨頭的屍體拎在手裡也沒有幾兩重。\n農夫悠長地嘆了口氣，把鼷獸的屍體埋進了地裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多可憐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"風雨無常，總有這樣的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果這些麥子死於這場雪，來年有多少人會死於荒災？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但也會有很多人幫助他們，會有很多人存活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生命本身不會斷絕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g16_beautifulland"},{"type":"narration","text":"天穹如幕。\n飄渺的綢緞似有千鈞之重，牢牢地隔開了二人的攻擊，向二人壓去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年，收手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫你造好這個心臟也算費了不少力氣，再打下去，把它拆了，前功盡棄多不划算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不見得有功夫說閒話吧，剛才那個炮仗明明差一點就炸到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不見你在我的畫裡到處搞破壞的力氣呢？你就不能鑄把大號剪刀把他的那幾匹布剪碎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是出點力氣啊！你的畫都要被他變成刺繡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還說我——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有點難啊，剛造好一個大號的炮仗就被他拆成線了，原來他一直能做到這種事的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為這些年他不會有心思用在鑽研能力上呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是為什麼，他好像對我們的能力都這麼熟悉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，他那邊，真的只有一個人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間差不多了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得的聚會，本來確實想再多聊聊，可時間實在是有點緊張，還是容我先告辭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在不想動這個手的，下次有機會再見的話，再給你們賠禮道歉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果還有機會的話……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對妹妹也下得去手，太不像話了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然猜到你不至於就這樣消失……你真的沒事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好不是在故意嚇唬我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當久違地做了一個長點的夢吧。抱歉，讓你們擔心啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是要來看看我這個弟弟，難得回來一次就鬧這麼一場，是真的不把這裡當家了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你每次做錯了事，臉上都會是這個表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……整六十七年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那今天必須要留下來吃頓飯了，有什麼話都可以飯桌上慢慢聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起姐姐。這一次，我不能聽話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是聽了另一位的話吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直躲起來的那位，還打算躲到什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼話，直接對我來說不好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g9_fairyfarmland"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"一人自遠處緩緩走來，走過了亙古的時間。又彷彿他從一開始就在這裡。\n時間與空間隨著他的足音靜止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總算願意現身了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多人……真是熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，還有心思在這裡胡鬧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不是，已經瘋了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家庭派對的氣氛，和我想像的實在不太一樣啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"電影裡面，看到通緝令上的家屬突然出現在家裡應該怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這到底是他自己，還是只是一個影子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臭棋簍子現在再做什麼事我都不會奇怪了，要是再在這裡搞出一隻歲相可真不是鬧著玩的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，黍姐，真的要動手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚蜀，玉門，還有這裡……你不覺得自己做得太過火了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捨小取大，各取所需，如此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看外面受災的田地，受苦的百姓……我可沒辦法聽過這句話就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"細算下來，這筆帳歸咎於誰還不好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就留下來，給我好好算清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這筆帳，從千年前就開始算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很久沒有來這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有我的事要做……北邊有戰事，行軍佈陣，總要身在一線的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“白骨露於野，千里無羽鳴。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連年征戰，到頭來，還是苦了這些田壟間的百姓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很在意他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你口中羸弱的族群，卻是我們真正意義上的師長。我們是模仿他們的樣子，找到了自己感興趣的那件事，才找到了自己在世間的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們與他們，到底不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又有多少不同呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨獸萬年壽命，蜉蝣朝生暮死，究其根本都是生在這方天地間的生命。是生命，都終有竟時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭殺伐，你為什麼偏偏挑中了這樣的差事？你到底從中看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"規則與秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最近學會了一種遊戲，“圍棋”。規則簡單，原理竟與兵法相通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這更讓我明白了一個道理，紛紛世事，看似混沌無序，但只要掌握了那個規則，就能計算出最終的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都很關注的那個結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這片死寂……這就是你看到的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不只是我們，也是這片大地上所有生靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多麼諷刺，滅亡為“果”，難道“生命”本身才是“因”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在這裡守望著，從來不會覺得厭倦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這世間萬物可愛，在它此時此刻的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萬物有時，人、獸、山水草木皆如是。這是人們說的“道”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"春草年年綠，我們來過，存在過，還不夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就接受了這樣的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你並不這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們何曾，真正作為自己活過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你該不會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想了很久……算了很久……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我終於……看到了另一個結局。"},{"type":"narration","text":"不遠處，積雪下，一株翠綠的禾苗探出頭來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能看到的，黍。"},{"type":"narration","text":"瘦削的男人伸出手來，指尖上還留著粗糲的棋繭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能不能替我看看，我的命數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“孤宿無兩；劫數茫茫，九死一生。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待……我會等著的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你可曾再見過她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明知道那是不可能的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我常常會想起她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說“有教無類”，想讓天底下每個人都能讀書識字……那些學府、書本，都是她留下的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在這方面倒是很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是最近這幾年，我已經忘了許多事……關於她的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了她寫下過哪些書卷，還有這一字真名的意思……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我分明記得，她曾與我對弈一局，她想要在局中告訴我什麼，如今卻無論如何想不起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……即使同為“我”們，也逃不過這樣的影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想找一個解法……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百八十一份，所有人都以為……你已經瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要回到那副軀殼中去，我需要祂的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺死祂，成為祂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用祂的力量，為這普天之下萬千生靈謀一份“大利”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會沒命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們會活下來。真正作為自己……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍，我想借你的一點力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們十二人，多一個人的力量，多一分勝算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"遼闊的農田阡陌交通，來人在棋盤上落下一子。\n黍伸開手掌，一把種子落在棋盤上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的因果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你沒有行差踏錯，確實在走向那個終點，這把種子會在適當的時候發芽，結出你想要的果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也會給我出題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總不能一直讓你刁難我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的事情已經談完了，還有什麼事，你自己說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是長大了，翅膀硬了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都一千歲了……姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我攔不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次走的時候還大吵了一架，這一次能不能給我留樣東西，當個念想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整座大荒城都被你織到了那幅錦繡裡，你還想要帶走什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是還有什麼不捨的，最好活著回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說的也是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕，能不能最後再問你要一樣東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幅畫，可以提前給我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會好好保管的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這帳本，今天就算做平了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰允許你走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歲老二！*炎國粗口*，我就知道是你個臭崽子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一天到晚不安生，不躲在破廟裡下你那破棋，撒潑耍渾鬧到我的地盤上來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個人在這鬧上一場，糟蹋了多少莊稼！你看我今天不揍你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"綢緞在熾白的火焰前一觸即燃，在轉瞬間灰飛煙滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逆向分解源石技藝？你什麼時候學會的……不對……這是“因果”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……你還剩多少顆子，還能擋我幾次火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天師……現在恐怕也不是動手的時候吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天機閣如今損失慘重，你要是再有三長兩短，大炎北邊的防線可就岌岌可危了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在炎國北境虎視眈眈的，可不止那些邪魔穢物吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少嚇唬人！我今天非要教訓你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那和你一道那幾位長生者，你也不在乎了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……你為了心智不受邪魔侵染才裝作這一副瘋瘋癲癲的樣子，倒沒忘了自己真正該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"權衡利弊，我們未必沒有可以合作的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"望","speakerId":"avg_npc_1237_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後會有期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g5_factory_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"結束了……嗎……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飄忽的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，都結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飄忽的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不惜性命，也要換來這個工程，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……功成名就，出人頭地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飄忽的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"功成名就之後又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個夢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萬里連城，可達天上宮闕；大地之廣，不再有百姓無遮風擋雨之處……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不成一番偉業，枉為天師……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飄忽的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道非要身居高位，萬人之上，才能為你夢裡的城池樓宇添磚加瓦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你……是天上的仙人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飄忽的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的夢，我收下了，就替了你抵押出去的性命吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（虛弱的呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萬侍郎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天上白玉京，十二樓五城……仙人撫我頂，結髮受長生……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n天上白玉京，十二樓五城。\n安得廣廈千萬間，大庇天下寒士俱歡顏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g2_desertedcityfield_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"榮晚晴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，那些怪物已經消失不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"榮晚晴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你救了我……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"談不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我路過的時候見你暈倒在地裡，這才喊你起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"榮晚晴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是大荒城的“老鄉長”，但也不是所有擔子都壓在你一個人身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用自己的命去和別人換這個地方的平安，不見得是筆划算買賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"榮晚晴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪能由得人選呢……大荒城，平安就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很在乎這個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"榮晚晴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大半輩子都活在這裡，根早就在這裡了，哪能不在乎呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路過的農業天師","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多保重，我先走啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"榮晚晴","speakerId":"avg_npc_1240_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，黍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"榮晚晴","speakerId":"avg_npc_1240_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該自由了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g11_shuresearchoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"培養器，培養器……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這株水稻還能救活……實驗還有希望……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是試驗田裡……“萬頃”的實驗專案，活下來的那一株水稻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石污染的土地上不是沒有可能種莊稼的，老師的實驗終於能看到結果了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看您的穿著，您也是這裡天師府的授業天師嗎？我好像從來沒有見過您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……我來到這裡不久。"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年似是有些困惑地抓了抓頭髮，覺得自己像是忘了什麼事。\n彷彿做了一個很久的夢，夢中情緒依稀還在心中縈繞，而夢中所見之人，所遇之事，卻無論如何回想不起來。\n愣神了一會，少年咧開嘴笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是天師府的學生，我叫禾生。我也該叫您老師了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，小禾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛，發現了一株很關鍵的莊稼……可以在源石污染過的土地上生長的莊稼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一項做了很久的研究，只要能推廣這種作物，我們就能把許多用不了的荒地變成農田，再也不會有人餓肚子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離這個目標可能還需要一段時間，可能是很長一段時間，但至少現在看到了一點希望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你願意，把往後的時間都投入在這件事上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那祝你好運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加油吧，我就不打擾你繼續做研究了，再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您這就要走了嗎？我還想向您多介紹一點，或許還需要您的一些指點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用啦，我相信，你一定可以實現你的目標的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫柔的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位老師，為什麼看上去，好像在哪裡看過呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老伯，送貨去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年的糧價怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的職農","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"荒年，每斤糧比去年貴三文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要算最後裝進口袋裡的錢，應該是比去年多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的職農","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不見得是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的職農","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"種地都是為了讓人填飽肚子，沒聽說過能靠種地發財。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教您一個多賺錢的方法，賣糧的時候，可以留個心眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"種出來的作物，成色最好的，標平價就近賣，賺口碑；成色普通的，標高價，僱商隊賣去遠點的地方，賣新奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的職農","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼亂七八糟的，從來沒聽說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的職農","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最好的作物當然是先留給家人朋友，成色普通的拿去賣，再差一些的只能拉去當飼料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年邁的職農","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這年輕人，心機太重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百灶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬧上這麼一齣，就這樣一聲不吭地走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是該走了。但我又沒有大哥那樣的能耐，您老人家要是不願意放我離開，我當然是走不掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就看您，是真不願意讓我走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想問你一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說要和炎國做的一筆交易，是從一開始就打算幫炎國造好這座大荒城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個生意人，做生意，講究互利互惠。要是只有一方得利，那豈不是跟強盜沒有區別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你們不是要與整個炎國為敵，那又何必要做這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兄弟兩個，就一定要和炎國走到打起來的地步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的那位姐妹，到底是被害死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且不說炎國百姓與我們無冤無仇，就算二哥他將這天下當作棋盤，可棋手對用久了的棋具也未嘗沒有感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，端坐廟堂之上，陰影之中的那幾位，必須要為自己做的事付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這筆帳，總得算算清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕搭上的是自己的命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以十二分之一的分身，去對抗那一整個整體，本就九死一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的命，也在帳本上標好了價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是瘋了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得，在很久之前，您就挨個來找過我們兄弟姐妹，問過每個人一個問題，又給我們各自指了路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“你在這片炎國大地上看到了什麼？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的答案從來沒有變過，想來二哥他也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*炎國粗口*，從一開始我就不喜歡你和那個老二，我講道理講不過你們，到時候還是要揍你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那個哥哥，從前就是這個脾氣，輸了棋就摔杯砸碗的。不過身體弱些，也摔不重就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次做過了火，有勞天師多擔待了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……滾吧滾吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後會有期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
